The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-7eddf4089806c88c18a5cbe56b49e9f9acb5c47e "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]

The retention rule is that records must be kept according to the schedule defined in the statute, which determines how long the records are kept. [[cite:obs-7eddf4089806c88c18a5cbe56b49e9f9acb5c47e "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]
